    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Andrzej Bargiel, a 37-year-old skier from "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Poland",
            "zh": "波兰"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", has just "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "made history",
            "ref": "v-make-history"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He climbed up Mount Qomolangma and skied all the way down. What’s more, he did it without using extra oxygen!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Mount Qomolangma is the highest mountain in the world. At the top of the mountain, the air is very thin. It is hard for climbers to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "breathe",
            "ref": "v-breathe"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Most people use bottled oxygen to help them breathe while climbing. But Bargiel did not. He said, “It was very hard. I had never been so high before. Skiing down Mount Qomolangma without oxygen was my dream.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "So far, more than 6,000 people have successfully climbed the mountain. But only about 200 have done it without bottled oxygen. Some people have skied down part of it, but no one skied down the whole way before Bargiel."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In an "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "interview",
            "ref": "v-interview"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", Bargiel said, “Before I went, no one believed I could do it. Even my brother wasn’t sure. But I learned to be patient. I learned that only I can "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "make my dream come true",
            "ref": "v-make-dream-true"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ".” Many people were proud of him. Even the Polish prime minister wrote online, “The sky is the limit? Not for "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Poles",
            "zh": "波兰人"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!”"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
